OL,3,AFrom weeks to hours - the rapid new
OL,4,Atest transforming brain tumour
OL,5,Adiagnosis
OL,6,
OL,7,FA rapid new test for brain tumours that
OL,8,Fthe NHS has started using can slash the
OL,9,Ftime it takes for an accurate diagnosis
OL,10,Ffrom up to eight weeks to two hours.
OL,12,FThe test, which is used by doctors to
OL,13,Fdiagnose which type of tumour a patient
OL,14,Fhas, should mean patients can start
OL,15,Ftreatment including radiotherapy and
OL,16,Fchemotherapy sooner, and are spared
OL,17,Fweeks of uncertainty.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
